
---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Mathematics — Antemundane sprǣc"
    description="Explore mathematics through patterns, structures, proofs, and challenging questions."
>
    <section class="subject-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE LANGUAGE OF NATURE</p>

        <h1>Mathematics</h1>

        <p class="subject-introduction">
            From the properties of numbers to the geometry of space,
            mathematics is a way of discovering patterns, expressing
            relationships, and understanding abstract structures.
        </p>

        <p class="subject-secondary">
            Observe. Question. Prove. Discover.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-explore">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</p>
            <h2>Explore Mathematics</h2>
            <p>
                Mathematics offers many ways to investigate the
                world of abstract ideas. Choose a path and start exploring.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject-branches">

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/mathematics/interesting-topics/">
                <span class="branch-number">01</span>
                <h3>Interesting Topics</h3>
                <p>
                    Beautiful theorems, surprising patterns,
                    and mathematical questions worth exploring.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Explore topics →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/mathematics/forum/">
                <span class="branch-number">02</span>
                <h3>Forum</h3>
                <p>
                    Share mathematical ideas, discuss problems,
                    and exchange different approaches to proofs.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Join the discussion →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/mathematics/games/">
                <span class="branch-number">03</span>
                <h3>Fun Games</h3>
                <p>
                    Discover mathematical principles through
                    puzzles, challenges, and interactive games.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Play and discover →</span>
            </a>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-questions">
        <p class="eyebrow">A FEW QUESTIONS TO BEGIN WITH</p>
        <h2>Where curiosity begins</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Why does Euler's identity connect five fundamental constants?</li>
            <li>Can infinity have different sizes?</li>
            <li>Why do some mathematical patterns appear throughout nature?</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
